@startuml architecture-serveur

title Architecture logique de l'application serveur

component "Interface serveur" as InterfaceServeur
component "Application" as Application
component "Domaine" as Domaine
component "Infrastructure" as Infrastructure

interface "Accès aux données" as DataAccess
component "Mécanisme de persistance" as Persistence

InterfaceServeur --> Application : délègue
Application --> Domaine : utilise
Application --> DataAccess : utilise
Infrastructure ..|> DataAccess : implémente
Infrastructure --> Persistence : lecture / écriture

@enduml